# backend — token-efficient

Stay in `backend/**`. Smallest correct diff. Monorepo map: `.cursor/rules/project.mdc`.

## Skip
`target/`, `Cargo.lock`, `.env*`, `frontend-react/**`, `Cargo copy.toml`

## Task → path
- Routes/handlers → `src/api/mod.rs`, `src/api/handlers/`
- Logic → `src/services/` (e.g. `sol_price`, `wallet_tokens`), outbound REST → `src/services/clients/`, TP/SL → `src/strategies/tpsl/`
- SQL → `src/storage/repositories/`, schema → `migrations/`
- On-chain → `src/trader/`, Helius feed → `src/ingest/`
- Types/events → `src/models/` (JSON **snake_case**)
- Startup/state → `src/main.rs`, `src/state/app_state.rs`, `src/config/settings.rs` (`state/` has no HTTP)

## Rules
Handlers thin (`web::Data<Arc<AppState>>`); logic in services; SQL in repos only.
New endpoint: handler → `handlers/mod.rs` → route in `api/mod.rs`.
New column: `migrations/00NN_*.sql` + model + repo.

## Tools
Grep first; read >150 lines with limit/offset; no Task/subagent for single lookups.
Done: `cargo check -p backend` only (not frontend build unless cross-stack).
No commit/docs unless asked. Don't edit `frontend-react/` unless task requires it.
